'''Ditto Skull''' is an {{Epic}} Cosmetic that copies another player's skull. It can be bought from the [[Bingo#Bingo Shop|Bingo Shop]] for {{Bingo Points|50}}, once the player has achieved {{Blue|Ⓑ Bingo Rank II (2)}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Ditto Skull''' can be bought from the [[Bingo#Bingo Shop|Bingo Shop]] for {{Bingo Points|50}}, once the player has achieved {{Blue|Ⓑ Bingo Rank II (2)}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Cosmetic
|rarity = e
|item_ability_name = Copycat
|item_ability_activation = Right Click
|item_ability_description = Click on a player to copy their skin's skull to this item! <br> {{Dark Gray|Skin stays until changed again.}}
|item_ability_cooldown = 10s
}}
Hold this item and right-click on a player to copy their skin. It can be used multiple times. 

Once used, the item becomes {{Soulbound|Co-op}} to prevent abuse. 

It can be placed on player's [[Private Island]] after capturing a skin.

== Trivia ==
*The name "Ditto" probably originates from the Pokémon of the same name, which is known for its ability to transform.
**The simplistic face also somewhat resembles Ditto.

